    {
      "subId": "1918519",
      "subQuestName": "Attempt to close the case",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "191855301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "191855301": {
            "id": "191855301",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "(No... I don't think that can be used to answer the question at hand.)",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "191855302"
            ]
          },
          "191855302": {
            "id": "191855302",
            "speakerId": 1072,
            "speakerName": "Lynette",
            "text": "Deductive mode deactivated. I think... we may be close to the actual answer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1918524",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "191854701"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "191854701": {
            "id": "191854701",
            "speakerId": 1072,
            "speakerName": "Lynette",
            "text": "Why would he leave such an obvious trail for us to follow when he took so much care to not leave any traces of Imitation Sinthe in his home?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1918525",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "191854901"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "191854901": {
            "id": "191854901",
            "speakerId": 1072,
            "speakerName": "Lynette",
            "text": "If Bonnie had Imitation Sinthe in her body, then she was a liability that had to be recovered at all costs. But if she wasn't carrying anything, then it would have made sense to tell Bernard not to worry.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "191854902"
            ]
          },
          "191854902": {
            "id": "191854902",
            "speakerId": 1072,
            "speakerName": "Lynette",
            "text": "And thinking about it, Bernard only attracted our attention in the first place because he came to look for Bonnie.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "191854903"
            ]
          },
          "191854903": {
            "id": "191854903",
            "speakerId": 1072,
            "speakerName": "Lynette",
            "text": "Could it be that the person who wrote the letter also knew nothing about Bonnie's whereabouts... or they had a separate goal entirely?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1918526",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "191855101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "191855101": {
            "id": "191855101",
            "speakerId": 1072,
            "speakerName": "Lynette",
            "text": "Yeah, according to Bernard, Pierre also supplied all of the goods... But if the Marechaussee Phantom's records are correct, Pierre should have lost all access to the materials required to create the Imitation Sinthe, and the Institute has also not reported any theft of their stocks."
          }
        }
      }
    },
