    {
      "subId": "1918543",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "191854301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "191854301": {
            "id": "191854301",
            "speakerId": 5191,
            "speakerName": "Chourei",
            "text": "Ah, sorry, but I can't go with you... Surely, you'll be able to handle him, what between Elodie's Gardemek and all three of you?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1918544",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "191854401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "191854401": {
            "id": "191854401",
            "speakerId": 1072,
            "speakerName": "Lynette",
            "text": "Perhaps... we are now closing in on the truth."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1918546",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "191854601"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "191854601": {
            "id": "191854601",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "About what we found in Poisson...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "191854602"
            ]
          },
          "191854602": {
            "id": "191854602",
            "speakerId": 1072,
            "speakerName": "Lynette",
            "text": "The Marechaussee Phantom found Bonnie and the Lefevere pendant at Pierre's residence. That was the beginning point of our investigation."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1918548",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "191854801"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "191854801": {
            "id": "191854801",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "About Bernard's letters...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "191854802"
            ]
          },
          "191854802": {
            "id": "191854802",
            "speakerId": 1072,
            "speakerName": "Lynette",
            "text": "Bernard claims to have received a letter last night from Pierre. In the letter, Pierre stated that he had gone into hiding. Is there something wrong with the letter...?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1918550",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "191855001"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "191855001": {
            "id": "191855001",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "There's an unexplained part in the operations of this trafficking ring...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "191855002"
            ]
          },
          "191855002": {
            "id": "191855002",
            "speakerId": 1072,
            "speakerName": "Lynette",
            "text": "Well, we've discovered that Bernard is responsible for the trafficking, while Pierre deals with \"supplying the goods.\" Is there something else in this scheme that we're missing?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1918552",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "191855201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "191855201": {
            "id": "191855201",
            "speakerId": 1072,
            "speakerName": "Lynette",
            "text": "The final question is: why did I sense that something wasn't right after hearing Bernard's testimony? Even more so than before..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1918554",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "191855401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "191855401": {
            "id": "191855401",
            "speakerId": 1072,
            "speakerName": "Lynette",
            "text": "Perhaps... we are now closing in on the truth."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1918556",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "191855601"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "191855601": {
            "id": "191855601",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "(No... I don't think that can be used to answer the question at hand.)",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "191855602"
            ]
          },
          "191855602": {
            "id": "191855602",
            "speakerId": 1072,
            "speakerName": "Lynette",
            "text": "There's no need to rush. Let's see if we can find any other suspicious points about this case."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1918559",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "191855901"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "191855901": {
            "id": "191855901",
            "speakerId": 1072,
            "speakerName": "Lynette",
            "text": "Only the lower halves of the barrels appear to have been submerged in water..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1918560",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "191856001"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "191856001": {
            "id": "191856001",
            "speakerId": 1081,
            "speakerName": "Chevreuse",
            "text": "But what are these other drugs for..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1918561",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "191856101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "191856101": {
            "id": "191856101",
            "speakerId": 1071,
            "speakerName": "Lyney",
            "text": "But what could these big bags be for then... If the goal is to keep the Imitation Sinthe hidden and sealed away, these bags seem a bit too conspicuous..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1918562",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "191856201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "191856201": {
            "id": "191856201",
            "speakerId": 1081,
            "speakerName": "Chevreuse",
            "text": "I can't believe how much progress we're making with this investigation... Without your help, getting this far would have taken me an awful lot of time and manpower."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1918563",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "191856301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "191856301": {
            "id": "191856301",
            "speakerId": 1071,
            "speakerName": "Lyney",
            "text": "It's rare to see Lynette in serious mode... I wonder how long she'll keep it activated for."
          }
        }
      }
    },
